 By Dan Primack &middot; Nov 19, 2026 
 
 
 𖥂 Our third annual Axios Future of Defense Summit kicks off today at 1:45pm ET in Washington, D.C.

 Guests include Boeing Defense CEO Steve Parker , In-Q-Tel CEO Steve Bowsher , Washington Harbour Partners CEO Mina Faltas , XYZ Venture Capital managing partner Ross Fubini , Mach Industries CEO Ethan Thornton , Rep. Gregory Meeks (D-N.Y.) and Sen. Joni Ernst (R-Iowa). Watch the livestream 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
